     1,
     "Hi Vincent and all,<div><br></div><div>Our team is currently using the SENS device with young children and older adults. As a current user of ActiGraph and GGIR, we are very interested to know if GGIR is compatible with <span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">their binary file format. Thank you.</span></div><div><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\">All the best.</font></div><div><font face=\"Arial, sans-serif\">Wendy<br></font><br></div>"
