   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Hi Wendy,</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Thanks for your message. The current status on this is:</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">I am happy to facilitate this, but I cannot do it for free (free software does not mean free time). The manufacturer is aware of this but has so far been reluctant to sponsor the development.</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Possible solutions:</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><ol style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"><li style=\"list-style-type:&quot;1. &quot;\"><span>Someone contacts Sens and convinces them to sponsor this development.</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type:&quot;2. &quot;\"><span>Someone sponsors me to develop this functionality.</span></li><li style=\"list-style-type:&quot;3. &quot;\"><span>Someone else develops the functionality where my role is limited to reviewing the solution.</span></li></ol><div><span><br></span></div><div>Thanks,</div><div><br></div><div><span>Vincent</span></div></div>"
